; A selsyn receiver in a round case. Faces +Z; the needle swings about Z, and
; the number is on the face rather than on the HUD because the instrument is
; the thing the player is looking at.
; Not saveable, deliberately: a repeater has no state of its own. It shows what
; its source shows, and the source is somebody else's to save.
